From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: Enable Rockchip TRNG on Radxa ZERO 3

rk356x.dtsi enables the TRNG only for RK3568. Enable it also for the
RK3566 based Radxa ZERO 3W/3E (same as the HAOS ODROID-M1S patch).
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero-3.dtsi	2026-11-13 00:38:07.650694376 +0200
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero-3.dtsi	2026-11-13 00:38:07.655400286 +0200
@@ -466,6 +466,10 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&rng {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &saradc {
 	vref-supply = <&vcca_1v8>;
 	status = "okay";
